{"5085090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astrojunk", "steam_appid": 5085090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Great Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/4afdd590ed5843d0f7cc422a9b6d83f2.poster.avif?t=1788277636\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/4afdd590ed5843d0f7cc422a9b6d83f2.webm?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/4afdd590ed5843d0f7cc422a9b6d83f2.mp4?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one goal: build a modular ship and get the hell out. But it’s not as simple as slapping on some space-glue. Your survival depends on mastering a frantic, multi-step industrial pipeline:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get a Grip</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your left and right hands entirely independently in a chaotic, physics-driven system. Fumble with switches, swing across gaps, and try not to accidentally punch your crewmates while desperately reaching for a rusty pipe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find raw resources and haul them back to your processing units. Power the machines on, throw the resources in, and watch them spit out usable scrap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fabricate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take that refined scrap to the Fabrication Stations. These aren’t your standard workbenches. They are massive, puzzle platforming nightmares. You and your crew will need to communicate, dodge hazards, and feed the machines to construct your ship components piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble the Rig</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a shiny new thruster or a rusty command module? Now physically drag that heavy hunk of metal all the way back to the Launch Pad. You need to successfully complete all the Fabrication Stations to get all the required modules for your ship. Snap them together at the pad, strap-in, grab hold and get ready for lift-off!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything Wants You Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/e66f7a549d8db3e1e378ff754380fced.poster.avif?t=1788277636\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/e66f7a549d8db3e1e378ff754380fced.webm?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/e66f7a549d8db3e1e378ff754380fced.mp4?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the clock ticks down to absolute zero, the planet isn't just sitting there waiting for the end. The environment is actively trying to kill you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Droids</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locals left their automated defense systems on. As time progresses, swarms of angry droids will spawn to rip you, your friends apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lethal Geysers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step. The planet's crust is unstable, and sudden geyser eruptions will launch you (and your hard-earned ship parts) into the stratosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incoming Artillery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That giant world-ending meteor isn’t coming alone. Smaller comets will constantly rain from the sky, slamming into the terrain and into you if you aren't watching your shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more…</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tick. Tock.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/bf959a559a2357acd7f06d77aa3f21d3.poster.avif?t=1788277636\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/bf959a559a2357acd7f06d77aa3f21d3.webm?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/bf959a559a2357acd7f06d77aa3f21d3.mp4?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The giant meteor is getting closer every second. Work together, yell at your friends, overcome the Fabrication Stations and bolt that ship together. If you don't build fast, you die fast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>ASTROJUNK</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Great Escape</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/4afdd590ed5843d0f7cc422a9b6d83f2.poster.avif?t=1788277636\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/4afdd590ed5843d0f7cc422a9b6d83f2.webm?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/4afdd590ed5843d0f7cc422a9b6d83f2.mp4?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have one goal: build a modular ship and get the hell out. But it’s not as simple as slapping on some space-glue. Your survival depends on mastering a frantic, multi-step industrial pipeline:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get a Grip</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your left and right hands entirely independently in a chaotic, physics-driven system. Fumble with switches, swing across gaps, and try not to accidentally punch your crewmates while desperately reaching for a rusty pipe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find raw resources and haul them back to your processing units. Power the machines on, throw the resources in, and watch them spit out usable scrap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fabricate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take that refined scrap to the Fabrication Stations. These aren’t your standard workbenches. They are massive, puzzle platforming nightmares. You and your crew will need to communicate, dodge hazards, and feed the machines to construct your ship components piece by piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assemble the Rig</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got a shiny new thruster or a rusty command module? Now physically drag that heavy hunk of metal all the way back to the Launch Pad. You need to successfully complete all the Fabrication Stations to get all the required modules for your ship. Snap them together at the pad, strap-in, grab hold and get ready for lift-off!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Everything Wants You Dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/e66f7a549d8db3e1e378ff754380fced.poster.avif?t=1788277636\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/e66f7a549d8db3e1e378ff754380fced.webm?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/e66f7a549d8db3e1e378ff754380fced.mp4?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the clock ticks down to absolute zero, the planet isn't just sitting there waiting for the end. The environment is actively trying to kill you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Droids</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locals left their automated defense systems on. As time progresses, swarms of angry droids will spawn to rip you, your friends apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lethal Geysers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step. The planet's crust is unstable, and sudden geyser eruptions will launch you (and your hard-earned ship parts) into the stratosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Incoming Artillery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That giant world-ending meteor isn’t coming alone. Smaller comets will constantly rain from the sky, slamming into the terrain and into you if you aren't watching your shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more…</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tick. Tock.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/bf959a559a2357acd7f06d77aa3f21d3.poster.avif?t=1788277636\" width=1170 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/bf959a559a2357acd7f06d77aa3f21d3.webm?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/extras/bf959a559a2357acd7f06d77aa3f21d3.mp4?t=1788277636\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The giant meteor is getting closer every second. Work together, yell at your friends, overcome the Fabrication Stations and bolt that ship together. If you don't build fast, you die fast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>ASTROJUNK</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Play in co-op as a crew of aliens racing to escape an impending meteor strike. Gather resources, fabricate scrap metal, survive brutal fabrication stations and assemble your spaceship while surviving the chaos... Work together to build and launch before time runs out!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/c76f81725296c7fd11fcf63f6d6460ffde74129a/header.jpg?t=1788277636", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/2e34239acc6fd2ce8631bf6048ca41093bcdb2fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788277636", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5085090/2e34239acc6fd2ce8631bf6048ca41093bcdb2fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788277636", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Monkey's Mirror Inc."], "publishers": ["Monkey's Mirror Inc."], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres"